### Environment Variable
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000/api/v1

### ----------------------------------------------------
### USER AUTHENTICATION ENDPOINTS
### ----------------------------------------------------

### 1. Register a New User
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "lakshit",
  "email": "lakshitprajapat2008@gmail.com",
  "password": "securePassword123"
}

### 2. Login User
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "lakshitprajapat2008@gmail.com",
  "password": "securePassword123"
}

### 3. Logout User
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "lakshitprajapat2008@gmail.com"
}


### ----------------------------------------------------
### POST CRUD ENDPOINTS
### ----------------------------------------------------

### 4. Create a Post
POST {{baseUrl}}/posts/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Lakshit",
  "description": "Learning Express.js and Node.js backend architecture - Lakshit Web Dev Assignment",
  "age": 18
}

### 5. Get All Posts
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts/getPosts

### 6. Update a Post (replace {{postId}} with actual ID from create/getPosts)
@postId = 6725dc01e3b5e4001a123456
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/posts/update/{{postId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Updated assignment post description by Lakshit"
}

### 7. Delete a Post (replace {{postId}} with actual ID)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/posts/delete/{{postId}}
